{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/svelte-table"},{"type":"text","value":" adapter is a wrapper around the core table logic. Most of it's job is related to managing state the \"svelte\" way, providing types and the rendering implementation of cell/header/footer templates."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"createsveltetable","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createSvelteTable"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Takes an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" object and returns a table."}]},{"type":"code","value":"<script>\n\nimport { createSvelteTable } from '@tanstack/svelte-table'\n\nconst table = createSvelteTable(options)\n\n</script>","lang":"svelte"}],"headings":[{"id":"createsveltetable","text":"createSvelteTable","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `@tanstack/svelte-table` adapter is a wrapper around the core table logic. Most of it's job is related to managing state the \"svelte\" way, providing types and the rendering implementation of cell/header/footer templates.\n\n## `createSvelteTable`\n\nTakes an `options` object and returns a table.\n\n```svelte\n<script>\n\nimport { createSvelteTable } from '@tanstack/svelte-table'\n\nconst table = createSvelteTable(options)\n\n</script>\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Svelte Table\n---\n\nThe `@tanstack/svelte-table` adapter is a wrapper around the core table logic. Most of it's job is related to managing state the \"svelte\" way, providing types and the rendering implementation of cell/header/footer templates.\n\n## `createSvelteTable`\n\nTakes an `options` object and returns a table.\n\n```svelte\n<script>\n\nimport { createSvelteTable } from '@tanstack/svelte-table'\n\nconst table = createSvelteTable(options)\n\n</script>\n```\n"}
